    "title": "Subway Surfers Secrets: How We Scored 25 Million Points (Multiplier Glitches, Boards & Pro Route Guide)",
    "excerpt": "Pro gamer masterclass on reaching 25M+ high scores in Subway Surfers. Complete 30x multiplier unlock guide, hoverboard tier list, key economy, and high-velocity obstacle navigation.",
    "category": "Tips",
